{"key":"StoryData/P10509.json|/dataList/16/content","kr_sha":"677ff7e743c4ee480916a4f72401b6a3a8797125408b6b94499826a2bb7e8abb","zh":"因為他像是落水狗一樣，以一副溼漉漉的樣子出現在我們面前。","origin":"paratranz","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"fb2b0969a45c0ef78713157c38556f810fa441a5"}
{"key":"StoryData/P10509.json|/dataList/17/content","kr_sha":"f8d6cd243c0d6b1efedc728774dfd659789dab0caa6c81269b9c6bc43280e162","zh":"他要求……加入我們的幫派。","origin":"paratranz","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"fb2b0969a45c0ef78713157c38556f810fa441a5"}
{"key":"StoryData/P10509.json|/dataList/18/content","kr_sha":"8f1ed78f9e7349abbf30a3d36d4a889b2745a5eb57b62103324122005b0b4cad","zh":"我看得出來……他不是另一個黑道的間諜，也並非什麼前來敲詐或勒索的人。","origin":"paratranz","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"fb2b0969a45c0ef78713157c38556f810fa441a5"}
{"key":"StoryData/P10509.json|/dataList/19/content","kr_sha":"f785fcf0b1b6528ccbd01629d8b3431ca206c67efe3932db621a65ab9db8e0d4","zh":"他滿含惡毒與絕望的目光……被自身無處安放的情感所動搖。","origin":"paratranz","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"fb2b0969a45c0ef78713157c38556f810fa441a5"}
{"key":"StoryData/P10509.json|/dataList/20/content","kr_sha":"61076f6804bb3133dec4afe55a803ebf26c154d3bfd4bb90390db6e34f7e72e7","zh":"即使殘破不堪，滿是汙跡……也能看出他身上衣物價值不菲，其中必有隱情。","origin":"paratranz","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"fb2b0969a45c0ef78713157c38556f810fa441a5"}
{"key":"StoryData/P10509.json|/dataList/21/content","kr_sha":"df6938170964d29ea8f22e0b6687c709b2f07bd440d012eb2755e703e71f475d","zh":"所以……我決定測試他。","origin":"paratranz","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"fb2b0969a45c0ef78713157c38556f810fa441a5"}
