{"key":"StoryData/P10509.json|/dataList/27/content","kr_sha":"e16aaad6e8389bfe6c17d06b23cd4d36a1a500c97dc271b755fbebeff6f19c03","zh":"另一件是……他不久後就帶著滿臉鮮血，攥著拳頭……將一具斷氣的屍體裝入袋中拖了回來。","origin":"paratranz","since":"raw-20261029","rules":"fb2b0969a45c0ef78713157c38556f810fa441a5"}
